WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:01.010
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:01.280 --> 01:06.160
Taming The Husband

3
01:06.240 --> 01:08.920
Episode 4

4
01:09.200 --> 01:10.480
He had the nerve to trick me!

5
01:10.560 --> 01:11.720
I grabbed him,

6
01:13.040 --> 01:14.720
and he signed it, fingerprint and all!

7
01:28.840 --> 01:31.880
Each family rank has its own token.

8
01:32.680 --> 01:33.800
This jade bracelet

9
01:33.960 --> 01:35.880
is the token for the Heaven rank.

10
01:36.480 --> 01:37.840
What do you think?

11
01:38.360 --> 01:39.480
I…

12
01:39.680 --> 01:41.160
I think I'm thirsty.

13
01:52.960 --> 01:56.360
If you have a question, just ask.

14
01:58.800 --> 02:01.440
How do the Xies move up in rank?

15
02:10.880 --> 02:12.080
Lady Jin,

16
02:12.480 --> 02:14.680
anyone who does the Xie family a great service

17
02:15.080 --> 02:17.000
can be recommended by the clan elders.

18
02:17.480 --> 02:19.440
With Madam's approval,

19
02:19.680 --> 02:21.640
they can then rise in rank.

20
02:22.560 --> 02:24.560
Then what counts as great service?

21
02:24.880 --> 02:27.960
Completing an important task for the Xies would count.

22
02:28.280 --> 02:29.360
For instance,

23
02:29.480 --> 02:31.960
Yangzhou's shipping festival is in early March.

24
02:32.360 --> 02:33.840
The great families and shipping guilds

25
02:34.080 --> 02:35.400
will all compete.

26
02:35.760 --> 02:39.880
The winner will receive the government's largest shipping contract.

27
02:40.040 --> 02:42.080
That would count.

28
02:46.640 --> 02:48.200
Would you like to see it?

29
02:49.280 --> 02:50.320
I'd like to do more than watch.

30
02:50.400 --> 02:51.560
I want to prove my worth!

31
02:51.640 --> 02:52.640
Look at me.

32
02:52.720 --> 02:54.400
I'm good with words and numbers, and I can fight!

33
02:56.880 --> 02:58.880
Matron Fang has served us for years.

34
02:59.480 --> 03:00.680
You've only just arrived,

35
03:01.080 --> 03:02.360
and we have many rules.

36
03:02.680 --> 03:04.760
You should learn from her.

37
03:05.280 --> 03:06.680
Once you've learned our ways,

38
03:06.840 --> 03:08.480
we can discuss it again.

39
03:09.640 --> 03:11.840
Are you saying I've broken the rules?

40
03:13.400 --> 03:14.760
My dear,

41
03:15.200 --> 03:17.080
you handled that so well,

42
03:17.280 --> 03:18.640
I was very pleased.

43
03:19.160 --> 03:20.560
Why would I blame you?

44
03:21.160 --> 03:23.280
But the Xies are a distinguished family.

45
03:24.000 --> 03:26.200
We must have rules to live by.

46
03:26.480 --> 03:29.200
You'll have to receive guests.

47
03:29.760 --> 03:31.080
At the shipping festival,

48
03:31.280 --> 03:35.480
people will be watching our family very closely.

49
03:39.000 --> 03:42.000
Xi is a little too lively.

50
03:42.480 --> 03:44.560
If she could stay by Matron Fang's side

51
03:44.640 --> 03:46.520
to learn manners and gain experience,

52
03:46.600 --> 03:48.680
then in future, whether here at home

53
03:48.760 --> 03:50.000
or out visiting people,

54
03:50.080 --> 03:51.840
she'd cause far less trouble.

55
03:52.360 --> 03:54.600
Madam, please do us a kindness.

56
03:56.040 --> 03:58.360
Let Matron Fang teach Xi, too.

57
03:58.760 --> 03:59.960
Listen to you.

58
04:00.040 --> 04:01.640
When have I ever refused?

59
04:02.440 --> 04:03.480
Thank you, Madam.

60
04:06.400 --> 04:08.240
I grew up in the countryside, too.

61
04:08.640 --> 04:10.200
I'm speaking from experience.

62
04:10.400 --> 04:12.000
It'll do you good.

63
04:12.480 --> 04:15.040
Take your time. You'll get the hang of it.

64
04:18.080 --> 04:19.120
Jianwei.

65
04:19.680 --> 04:21.360
I know I'm hard to get along with.

66
04:22.240 --> 04:23.600
You've served me for years.

67
04:23.680 --> 04:25.080
You must have your grievances.

68
04:25.560 --> 04:28.360
Whatever you're planning, make me your target.

69
04:28.640 --> 04:29.640
Why drag others into it?

70
04:29.720 --> 04:30.880
No. That's not it.

71
04:32.680 --> 04:33.760
It's because…

72
04:34.840 --> 04:36.360
My mother got sick recently.

73
04:36.760 --> 04:38.000
I don't have any money.

74
04:39.400 --> 04:40.400
And now,

75
04:40.480 --> 04:42.280
you turn your nose up at good tea?

76
04:42.400 --> 04:43.880
Do you think these leaves

77
04:44.160 --> 04:46.640
aren't as good as someone else's used tea leaves?

78
04:49.840 --> 04:53.240
I've heard mistakes happen when you rush the math.

79
04:54.200 --> 04:55.440
Could you check their work for me?

80
04:56.280 --> 04:58.320
Then tell me what you find.

81
04:58.400 --> 05:01.560
Then I will brew you a cup of fine tea.

82
05:09.800 --> 05:11.480
Ma'am! Ma'am! Ma'am!

83
05:12.760 --> 05:13.880
Ma'am! Ma'am!

84
05:14.040 --> 05:15.880
Take a break. I'll do it.

85
05:16.400 --> 05:17.400
All right.

86
05:29.080 --> 05:30.080
That night,

87
05:30.760 --> 05:32.480
you said you'd collect the debt the next day.

88
05:33.280 --> 05:34.880
I wanted Miss Xi to pay me,

89
05:35.200 --> 05:37.160
so while you were asleep, I tore out the entries.

90
05:37.640 --> 05:39.000
I regretted it at once.

91
05:39.520 --> 05:40.560
And…

92
05:41.360 --> 05:43.240
I was too ashamed to ask for the money.

93
05:43.400 --> 05:44.440
You really are a fool.

94
05:45.240 --> 05:47.320
You did the job, and never even got paid.

95
05:47.400 --> 05:48.440
That's your first mistake.

96
05:49.040 --> 05:50.480
Someone put you up to it,

97
05:51.280 --> 05:53.080
yet you don't know who's behind it.

98
05:53.280 --> 05:54.480
That's your second.

99
05:56.840 --> 05:58.080
Am I right,

100
06:00.080 --> 06:01.200
Yingtao?

101
06:07.280 --> 06:09.680
I don't understand what you mean, my lord.

102
06:11.200 --> 06:12.560
If you've done nothing wrong,

103
06:13.440 --> 06:15.840
why didn't you tell your mistress?

104
06:16.200 --> 06:17.280
I thought

105
06:17.640 --> 06:20.400
Jianwei would tell you, my lord.

106
06:20.800 --> 06:21.840
In other words,

107
06:22.880 --> 06:25.040
you knew he was watching

108
06:25.800 --> 06:26.800
and saw what he was planning.

109
06:26.880 --> 06:29.880
But instead of stopping him, you helped him along.

110
06:40.280 --> 06:41.840
Ma'am! Ma'am! Ma'am!

111
06:43.080 --> 06:44.120
Ma'am! Ma'am!

112
06:44.400 --> 06:46.280
Take a break. I'll do it.

113
06:50.680 --> 06:51.680
All right.

114
06:55.360 --> 06:56.800
Grandmother trusts you.

115
06:57.040 --> 06:58.640
That's why she sent you to serve us.

116
06:58.840 --> 07:00.000
I held my tongue earlier

117
07:00.080 --> 07:01.880
out of respect for Grandmother.

118
07:03.040 --> 07:04.400
I may have a bad temper,

119
07:04.480 --> 07:06.200
but I won't make you stay.

120
07:06.880 --> 07:08.280
If you don't want to serve us,

121
07:08.360 --> 07:10.000
go tell her that yourself.

122
07:10.400 --> 07:12.880
Pack your things and get out of this house.

123
07:14.680 --> 07:15.760
My lord!

124
07:15.960 --> 07:17.160
My lord, I'm truly sorry!

125
07:17.240 --> 07:18.320
My lord!

126
07:18.880 --> 07:20.480
Please don't send me away.

127
07:20.800 --> 07:22.760
I grew up here.

128
07:23.080 --> 07:24.400
It's freezing outside.

129
07:24.480 --> 07:26.200
Where could I go?

130
07:26.480 --> 07:28.240
My lord, please!

131
07:28.840 --> 07:30.440
They all say you value old ties.

132
07:30.880 --> 07:32.480
And what history do you and I share?

133
07:32.560 --> 07:33.560
Xie Yan!

134
07:35.480 --> 07:37.600
I've barely left, and you're already bullying someone.

135
07:40.000 --> 07:41.520
Why are you crying?

136
07:41.680 --> 07:42.760
Get up.

137
07:48.880 --> 07:50.720
She used to serve my grandmother.

138
07:50.800 --> 07:52.000
She didn't want to serve you.

139
07:52.400 --> 07:53.760
The second branch found out

140
07:53.880 --> 07:56.880
and offered her money to tear pages out of the ledger.

141
07:57.400 --> 07:58.680
She was too scared to do it,

142
07:59.160 --> 08:00.560
so she put Jianwei up to it.

143
08:08.680 --> 08:09.800
You didn't want to serve me.

144
08:10.480 --> 08:12.080
I can see why.

145
08:13.120 --> 08:14.200
Yingtao,

146
08:14.400 --> 08:16.680
if you want to leave, just nod.

147
08:16.880 --> 08:18.960
I'll ask Madam to let you go back.

148
08:32.880 --> 08:33.880
If you say nothing,

149
08:34.000 --> 08:35.280
I'll take it you're staying.

150
08:35.480 --> 08:37.280
But you'll still have to be punished,

151
08:37.560 --> 08:38.880
and so will Jianwei.

152
08:39.280 --> 08:41.880
Madam said... What's that saying?

153
08:43.320 --> 08:44.640
We must have ru-- rules…

154
08:45.280 --> 08:47.400
To live by. That's right.

155
08:48.280 --> 08:49.480
To live by.

156
08:50.440 --> 08:51.880
We must have rules to live by.

157
08:52.160 --> 08:54.800
Yingtao, you've been here a long time.

158
08:54.880 --> 08:56.960
Tell me, what's the proper punishment?

159
08:57.560 --> 08:58.760
Fifteen strokes of the rod

160
08:59.600 --> 09:01.040
and six months' wages.

161
09:01.240 --> 09:02.360
We'll skip the beating.

162
09:02.440 --> 09:03.480
You'll lose six months' wages,

163
09:03.560 --> 09:04.680
and so will Jianwei.

164
09:04.960 --> 09:06.280
Don't do it again.

165
09:06.440 --> 09:08.400
You wouldn't like to see me angry!

166
09:09.520 --> 09:10.680
Thank you, my lady!

167
09:10.760 --> 09:11.760
Thank you, my lady. Thank you!

168
09:16.600 --> 09:17.680
Off you go.

169
09:19.760 --> 09:20.880
Thank you, my lord.

170
09:21.080 --> 09:22.200
Thank you, my lord.

171
09:30.280 --> 09:31.960
One betrayal, and they're out for good.

172
09:32.080 --> 09:33.280
Don't tell me you're a fool, too.

173
09:35.160 --> 09:36.960
You've kept Jianwei on, haven't you?

174
09:38.160 --> 09:39.200
He had his reasons.

175
09:39.280 --> 09:41.360
Then perhaps Yingtao had hers, too.

176
09:41.440 --> 09:42.560
It's enough if she mends her ways.

177
09:42.960 --> 09:44.480
People…

178
09:44.640 --> 09:46.640
-What's that saying? No one… -No one's perfect.

179
09:47.000 --> 09:49.240
-That's right. -You fool.

180
09:49.560 --> 09:50.920
Well, ignorance is bliss.

181
09:51.000 --> 09:53.080
If you have to figure out every little thing,

182
09:53.160 --> 09:54.320
you'll wear yourself out.

183
10:00.760 --> 10:02.080
Lady Jin, you're a beginner.

184
10:02.280 --> 10:04.480
Use satin stitch for the orchids.

185
10:04.960 --> 10:06.440
Just keep the stitches even.

186
10:06.800 --> 10:08.440
Miss Xi, you know the basics.

187
10:08.680 --> 10:11.480
Add gold-thread couching around the orchids

188
10:11.760 --> 10:12.880
for a finer finish.

189
10:16.800 --> 10:18.280
Men should use plain colors.

190
10:18.480 --> 10:20.480
Use pale blue and cream thread.

191
10:20.680 --> 10:23.960
Young ladies may use a little lavender or pale pink.

192
10:24.040 --> 10:25.880
But never use bright red.

193
10:26.080 --> 10:27.760
That's for the principal wife.

194
10:56.080 --> 10:57.400
What a mess you've made!

195
10:57.680 --> 10:58.720
Jin Baozhu!

196
10:58.840 --> 11:01.680
You couldn't stand that mine was better, so you ruined mine, too!

197
11:01.800 --> 11:03.600
Why are you so horrible?

198
11:03.680 --> 11:05.200
-She hit me! -What's your problem?

199
11:05.640 --> 11:07.680
Miss Xi, what are you doing?

200
11:08.120 --> 11:09.200
I…

201
11:11.000 --> 11:12.880
Mother!

202
11:13.360 --> 11:14.680
It was her again!

203
11:15.400 --> 11:17.400
Every time, I see her leave first,

204
11:17.480 --> 11:20.280
and the next thing I know, my work's been ruined.

205
11:20.880 --> 11:23.960
I don't know what dirty trick she pulled.

206
11:24.040 --> 11:26.440
She got me punished, too!

207
11:27.040 --> 11:28.400
My darling.

208
11:28.480 --> 11:29.760
Of course I know.

209
11:29.840 --> 11:31.200
With those little schemes of hers,

210
11:31.280 --> 11:32.600
she pretends to be so innocent,

211
11:32.680 --> 11:34.200
but she's setting traps for you.

212
11:34.280 --> 11:35.280
You lose your composure

213
11:35.480 --> 11:36.760
in front of Matron Fang

214
11:36.840 --> 11:38.440
and make a fool of yourself, don't you?

215
11:39.280 --> 11:40.640
Xi, look at me.

216
11:41.680 --> 11:42.960
From now on, whatever happens,

217
11:43.040 --> 11:45.600
you mustn't make a scene in front of everyone.

218
11:46.760 --> 11:47.760
-Xie Xi! -There, there.

219
11:47.880 --> 11:49.240
Use your head.

220
11:49.680 --> 11:51.120
If she'd really done it,

221
11:51.480 --> 11:53.480
why would she have ruined her own work, too?

222
11:53.880 --> 11:55.280
How can you blame me?

223
11:55.480 --> 11:57.880
You told me they'd never get the money back.

224
11:58.040 --> 11:59.040
I was so excited

225
11:59.120 --> 12:00.600
to go to the Lus' and watch the fun.

226
12:00.680 --> 12:01.800
And what happened?

227
12:03.160 --> 12:06.880
I ended up the biggest joke of all!

228
12:07.560 --> 12:09.880
I only told you to sweet-talk Lu Ziyu a little.

229
12:10.040 --> 12:11.680
You were meant to use him.

230
12:11.840 --> 12:14.560
Who knew you'd charge into battle yourself

231
12:14.640 --> 12:15.880
and make yourself a target!

232
12:17.280 --> 12:18.600
You're a concubine's daughter,

233
12:18.680 --> 12:20.400
with nothing but a pretty face.

234
12:20.480 --> 12:22.480
You haven't got a brain in your head!

235
12:23.760 --> 12:25.800
You're insulting me?

236
12:26.840 --> 12:27.840
Enough.

237
12:27.920 --> 12:28.920
You're a concubine's son yourself!

238
12:29.000 --> 12:30.640
You-- Who are you to lecture me?

239
12:32.560 --> 12:33.680
I am a concubine's son,

240
12:33.880 --> 12:35.200
but at least I've got a brain.

241
12:35.280 --> 12:36.280
Unlike you!

242
12:36.400 --> 12:37.600
I told you to win over a maid.

243
12:37.680 --> 12:39.920
Instead, you set the tea down and walked away.

244
12:40.360 --> 12:41.360
You didn't win her over.

245
12:41.440 --> 12:42.440
You just handed someone else

246
12:42.520 --> 12:43.600
a chance to get her on their side.

247
12:43.680 --> 12:45.800
A maid who thinks she's a princess!

248
12:46.240 --> 12:47.880
Xie Qiao, I'll kill you!

249
12:47.960 --> 12:49.280
Enough. Enough!

250
12:49.360 --> 12:50.480
Stop it.

251
12:51.400 --> 12:54.080
You're both my own flesh and blood.

252
12:54.600 --> 12:57.160
Put that energy into fighting our enemies together.

253
13:00.680 --> 13:02.560
There, there. Enough.

254
13:06.200 --> 13:07.360
Qiao,

255
13:07.760 --> 13:09.000
what do you think

256
13:09.560 --> 13:11.160
we should do?

257
13:35.080 --> 13:36.160
Come on, give me a compliment.

258
13:46.600 --> 13:47.960
I embroidered a sparrow, you know.

259
13:54.400 --> 13:55.640
I don't lie.

260
13:58.480 --> 13:59.480
I hate you.

261
14:22.680 --> 14:24.200
What flower is this?

262
14:26.240 --> 14:28.480
It's a daylily.

263
14:30.880 --> 14:32.080
It's beautifully done.

264
14:32.480 --> 14:33.480
Who embroidered it?

265
14:33.560 --> 14:34.680
I'd like to get a few tips from her.

266
14:44.560 --> 14:45.640
You're too late.

267
14:46.880 --> 14:48.240
She's already

268
14:48.720 --> 14:49.720
gone.

269
14:49.800 --> 14:51.640
Gone? Where?

270
14:54.160 --> 14:55.400
Didn't you say

271
14:55.960 --> 14:57.280
"Out of sight, out of mind"?

272
14:59.040 --> 15:00.440
Why bring it back to embroider?

273
15:10.840 --> 15:14.440
Do you think Xie Xi ruined her own work to pin the blame on me?

274
15:16.440 --> 15:18.600
But judging by how she acted, I don't think so.

275
15:25.440 --> 15:26.440
Any ideas?

276
15:29.120 --> 15:30.240
None.

277
15:31.360 --> 15:32.760
It's so infuriating!

278
15:32.880 --> 15:34.680
When I catch that bastard,

279
15:34.880 --> 15:36.480
I'll knock him flat on his face!

280
15:38.880 --> 15:40.760
Can I put up a shed in your courtyard?

281
15:41.880 --> 15:42.960
What for?

282
15:44.160 --> 15:45.560
I want to butcher pigs.

283
17:13.200 --> 17:14.320
I…

284
17:40.240 --> 17:41.240
Lady Jin says,

285
17:41.320 --> 17:43.560
if she can't butcher pigs, she can at least cut down trees.

286
17:43.880 --> 17:45.800
I couldn't stop her.

287
17:46.800 --> 17:48.240
By the sunlit window, a lonely figure.

288
17:48.680 --> 17:50.040
The wind stills, and all is silent.

289
17:50.440 --> 17:52.280
My lord, don't let the loneliness get you down.

290
17:52.640 --> 17:53.680
The New Year is almost here.

291
17:53.760 --> 17:54.760
The fourth young master will soon return--

292
17:54.840 --> 17:55.880
Jianwei.

293
17:56.400 --> 17:58.480
Go and choose a few lovely camellias to plant.

294
17:59.200 --> 18:00.560
Only ones with white buds.

295
18:01.760 --> 18:02.880
Yes, my lord.

296
18:03.880 --> 18:04.960
Come back.

297
18:06.680 --> 18:08.000
Pale pink or deep pink ones,

298
18:08.080 --> 18:09.200
if there are any decent ones,

299
18:09.280 --> 18:10.480
choose a few of those, too.

300
18:10.680 --> 18:12.280
Not too many. They're gaudy.

301
18:13.560 --> 18:14.680
Yes, my lord.

302
18:17.440 --> 18:19.280
What about heavenly bamboo and wintersweet?

303
18:19.360 --> 18:21.240
They're in season and look lovely, too.

304
18:23.200 --> 18:25.280
Heavenly bamboo berries are too showy.

305
18:25.480 --> 18:26.600
No.

306
18:27.200 --> 18:28.240
Wintersweet

307
18:28.680 --> 18:30.280
grows in Xie Qiao's courtyard.

308
18:30.880 --> 18:32.000
Definitely not.

309
18:33.480 --> 18:34.600
Yes, my lord.

310
18:36.040 --> 18:37.160
Come back.

311
18:40.440 --> 18:41.480
I'll go with you.

312
18:43.080 --> 18:44.200
Yes, my lord.

313
18:55.400 --> 18:56.600
It should've been like this ages ago.

314
18:56.680 --> 18:58.760
So lively and so pretty!

315
19:00.080 --> 19:01.080
A few camellias,

316
19:01.480 --> 19:02.600
and you're this happy?

317
19:02.800 --> 19:04.400
You fool. What do you know?

318
19:04.600 --> 19:06.840
Put one in my hair later to ward off bad luck.

319
19:07.080 --> 19:09.280
More will bloom in a few days.

320
19:09.360 --> 19:10.680
Then I want bright red ones.

321
19:10.960 --> 19:12.160
I want rosy pink ones!

322
19:13.480 --> 19:14.680
I hope you choke on your bad taste.

323
19:15.280 --> 19:16.360
I hope you choke on your own venom!

324
19:20.840 --> 19:21.920
Jin Baozhu!

325
19:22.400 --> 19:24.280
-Come back. -No!

326
19:25.480 --> 19:26.760
One flower's bloomed.

327
19:27.080 --> 19:28.160
You'll regret missing it.

328
19:34.160 --> 19:35.240
Where?

329
19:44.640 --> 19:50.440
Name-change petition "Zhu" changed from "pig" to "pearl"

330
19:50.760 --> 19:51.760
What's this?

331
19:51.840 --> 19:54.160
A few days ago, as your husband,

332
19:54.400 --> 19:56.480
I submitted to your township official a petition to change your name.

333
19:57.040 --> 19:58.600
And… what's this?

334
19:59.960 --> 20:01.360
This is the household register entry.

335
20:03.040 --> 20:04.280
And these papers are the proof.

336
20:06.040 --> 20:08.480
Read it to me! What does it say?

337
20:11.280 --> 20:14.160
"Jin Baozhu, with 'zhu' for 'pig,'

338
20:15.160 --> 20:16.160
is hereby renamed

339
20:16.840 --> 20:18.160
Jin Baozhu, with 'zhu' for 'pearl.'"

340
20:46.680 --> 20:47.760
"Pearl"

341
20:50.640 --> 20:53.680
will be the first character I teach you.

342
21:14.520 --> 21:17.320
The moon shines bright

343
21:38.360 --> 21:39.480
Congratulations,

344
21:40.280 --> 21:41.280
Jin Baozhu.

345
22:00.240 --> 22:02.640
The gift you gave me today made me very happy.

346
22:02.720 --> 22:05.200
To thank you, I have a gift for you, too.

347
22:08.480 --> 22:10.080
You called me here in the dead of night

348
22:11.200 --> 22:12.360
just to see this?

349
22:20.680 --> 22:22.280
Your ugly handwriting was better.

350
22:22.480 --> 22:23.800
It's not ugly.

351
22:23.880 --> 22:25.960
You just have to look a little harder to see the beauty.

352
22:26.160 --> 22:27.160
Besides,

353
22:27.240 --> 22:29.080
the gift I have for you isn't this wooden dummy.

354
22:29.400 --> 22:30.960
It's a grandson.

355
22:31.280 --> 22:32.280
Thank you.

356
22:32.360 --> 22:34.880
I've never been a father, and now I'm a grandfather.

357
22:35.880 --> 22:37.120
It's that thief

358
22:37.200 --> 22:38.280
who keeps ruining my work.

359
22:38.400 --> 22:40.160
I can never catch him,

360
22:40.480 --> 22:42.680
but with this wooden dummy, things will be different.

361
22:43.680 --> 22:46.200
This wooden dummy of mine can catch thieves.

362
22:47.840 --> 22:48.960
Catch thieves?

363
23:14.800 --> 23:16.400
Take that!

364
23:17.480 --> 23:18.560
Take that! Take that!

365
23:18.640 --> 23:20.200
That's for playing tricks behind my back!

366
23:20.280 --> 23:21.560
And that's for kicking my dummy!

367
23:21.640 --> 23:22.720
-Stop hitting me! -That's for kicking my dummy!

368
23:23.000 --> 23:24.000
-And for kicking my dummy! -Help!

369
23:24.080 --> 23:25.680
-Take that! Take that! -Help!

370
23:26.080 --> 23:27.240
I've finally caught you!

371
23:27.320 --> 23:28.320
Stop hitting me!

372
23:28.400 --> 23:29.480
Someone stop her!

373
23:31.680 --> 23:32.680
He's my younger brother!

374
23:32.800 --> 23:34.680
-What? -Yan!

375
23:35.680 --> 23:36.760
Yan!

376
23:49.720 --> 23:50.760
Lady Jin!

377
23:50.840 --> 23:51.880
Lady Jin!

378
23:51.960 --> 23:53.280
Lady Jin, you can't do this!

379
23:54.080 --> 23:55.480
What's going on here?

380
23:55.760 --> 23:56.760
It's my fault.

381
23:56.840 --> 23:57.840
I couldn't stop Lady Jin.

382
23:57.920 --> 23:59.840
It's not her fault. If you want, you can punish me.

383
23:59.960 --> 24:02.200
But before you do, my lady, I want an explanation.

384
24:02.280 --> 24:04.120
You shrew!

385
24:04.200 --> 24:05.200
I'll tear your hair out!

386
24:05.280 --> 24:06.400
I'll knock you off your perch

387
24:06.480 --> 24:07.480
and show you for what you are!

388
24:07.560 --> 24:09.080
Enough. Sit down.

389
24:10.280 --> 24:11.360
My boy,

390
24:11.480 --> 24:12.560
weren't you on the boat,

391
24:12.640 --> 24:14.360
learning the business from your father?

392
24:14.440 --> 24:15.560
He isn't back yet.

393
24:15.640 --> 24:17.080
How come you're back before him?

394
24:17.280 --> 24:19.080
Mother, if I hadn't come back,

395
24:19.160 --> 24:20.440
those people in the second branch

396
24:20.520 --> 24:21.600
would've ruined my brother's name!

397
24:21.680 --> 24:22.880
What are you waiting for?

398
24:23.040 --> 24:24.760
She dared to tie up a Xie young master!

399
24:24.840 --> 24:26.400
Throw her out at once!

400
24:26.480 --> 24:28.480
Madam, I'm rough around the edges.

401
24:28.560 --> 24:29.640
I don't mince words.

402
24:29.880 --> 24:31.680
I hear you're kind and generous.

403
24:31.760 --> 24:33.120
If you can put up with him,

404
24:33.200 --> 24:34.840
you can put up with your new daughter-in-law, too.

405
24:35.080 --> 24:36.200
So I'll speak plainly.

406
24:36.600 --> 24:37.920
I came here with him,

407
24:38.000 --> 24:39.360
but you haven't so much as looked at me.

408
24:39.440 --> 24:40.640
That's hardly fair, is it?

409
24:41.600 --> 24:43.080
Still, I did tie up your son,

410
24:43.160 --> 24:44.440
so let's call it even.

411
24:45.040 --> 24:46.120
From now on,

412
24:46.200 --> 24:47.560
let's say what we mean.

413
24:47.640 --> 24:48.640
Can we do that or not?

414
24:48.720 --> 24:49.800
Give me a straight answer.

415
24:50.280 --> 24:52.240
How dare you? You're just a village woman!

416
24:52.320 --> 24:54.000
-You dare speak to my mother like that? -Yi.

417
24:54.240 --> 24:55.280
-Mother! -Sit down.

418
25:02.680 --> 25:04.480
Come. You sit, too.

419
25:09.440 --> 25:11.480
My boy was learning the business

420
25:11.560 --> 25:13.400
on the boat with his father.

421
25:14.000 --> 25:15.880
He wasn't due home until New Year.

422
25:16.440 --> 25:17.480
Today,

423
25:17.640 --> 25:19.320
I was so delighted to see him

424
25:19.400 --> 25:20.760
that I neglected you.

425
25:21.240 --> 25:22.640
That was rude of me.

426
25:23.200 --> 25:24.560
Please forgive me.

427
25:27.680 --> 25:29.200
We're family.

428
25:29.680 --> 25:31.000
Of course

429
25:32.960 --> 25:35.360
we should say what we mean.

430
25:35.960 --> 25:38.000
Good. While Matron Fang was teaching me,

431
25:38.080 --> 25:39.080
he was sabotaging my work.

432
25:39.160 --> 25:40.160
I caught him in the act.

433
25:40.240 --> 25:42.080
Wasn't he in the wrong? Shouldn't you punish him?

434
25:42.480 --> 25:44.480
-Yi. -Mother.

435
25:46.680 --> 25:47.840
Don't be hasty.

436
25:48.360 --> 25:49.480
Let me ask you.

437
25:49.960 --> 25:51.400
Suppose at breakfast today,

438
25:51.880 --> 25:53.920
the food wasn't to my liking,

439
25:54.000 --> 25:56.360
so I broke the cook's hand.

440
25:57.080 --> 25:58.320
Would you say

441
25:58.640 --> 26:00.480
that was unfair?

442
26:01.160 --> 26:02.560
Of course it would be.

443
26:02.680 --> 26:03.680
He meant no harm

444
26:03.760 --> 26:04.880
and hadn't hurt you.

445
26:05.360 --> 26:06.880
Yi was only protecting his brother.

446
26:07.480 --> 26:09.000
He didn't hurt you, either.

447
26:09.680 --> 26:11.200
But you hurt him

448
26:11.480 --> 26:13.640
and kept him tied up all night before dragging him here.

449
26:14.280 --> 26:15.280
Tell me,

450
26:16.200 --> 26:17.800
who's really at fault here?

451
26:17.880 --> 26:18.920
But…

452
26:19.000 --> 26:21.080
Matron Fang punished me because of him.

453
26:21.240 --> 26:22.680
How is that not hurting me?

454
26:24.280 --> 26:26.680
He made trouble. I'll deal with him.

455
26:26.760 --> 26:27.760
Matron Fang was unreasonable.

456
26:27.840 --> 26:29.360
Madam will deal with her.

457
26:29.800 --> 26:31.080
The Xies are a large, powerful family.

458
26:31.600 --> 26:32.800
If everyone

459
26:32.880 --> 26:34.640
took matters into their own hands,

460
26:35.080 --> 26:36.560
we'd have chaos.

461
26:37.440 --> 26:39.640
Each household must keep its own in line.

462
26:40.280 --> 26:41.600
That's the rule.

463
26:41.960 --> 26:45.400
Matron Fang has taught you by example all this time,

464
26:45.480 --> 26:47.480
yet you haven't learned a thing.

465
26:47.880 --> 26:51.360
Why shouldn't she punish you?

466
26:56.280 --> 26:57.560
Yi deserves punishment.

467
26:59.280 --> 27:00.400
So do you.

468
27:02.240 --> 27:03.640
You ignored the family rules.

469
27:03.840 --> 27:04.880
For that,

470
27:06.440 --> 27:08.240
he'll copy our family code 100 times.

471
27:09.200 --> 27:10.480
Since you can't read or write well,

472
27:10.880 --> 27:13.040
you're not to go out for half a month.

473
27:13.880 --> 27:15.240
Let that be a lesson to you.

474
27:17.560 --> 27:18.640
Serves you right.

475
27:36.720 --> 27:38.680
My lady, don't be angry.

476
27:38.880 --> 27:40.280
Please calm down, my lady.

477
27:40.480 --> 27:41.560
-Jin Baozhu! -My lady!

478
27:44.280 --> 27:45.360
Come here.

479
27:52.040 --> 27:54.120
Didn't you want to learn to read?

480
27:54.200 --> 27:55.200
Read.

481
27:56.880 --> 27:58.400
"This is outrageous!"

482
27:58.480 --> 28:00.160
The Southern Dynasties' "Biography of Yu Cong" records

483
28:00.440 --> 28:01.720
that when the emperor's grandson and heir was deposed,

484
28:01.800 --> 28:03.600
Yu Cong privately condemned it:

485
28:03.800 --> 28:06.600
"Wang and Xu donned military garb and deposed the emperor!

486
28:06.680 --> 28:08.480
This is outrageous!"

487
28:08.680 --> 28:09.720
What I wrote

488
28:09.840 --> 28:10.960
were those four characters:

489
28:11.240 --> 28:12.280
"This is outrageous!"

490
28:13.000 --> 28:15.440
Today, we use them to condemn treason

491
28:15.560 --> 28:16.760
and acts against human decency,

492
28:16.840 --> 28:19.680
as well as to mock people who act like utter fools

493
28:19.880 --> 28:21.360
and have no respect for the rules.

494
28:22.080 --> 28:23.760
Is there a saying for the opposite?

495
28:24.480 --> 28:25.600
Yes.

496
28:38.440 --> 28:39.440
"Only natural"

497
28:39.520 --> 28:40.880
Since heaven and earth formed from chaos,

498
28:41.040 --> 28:42.040
there's been a natural order.

499
28:42.200 --> 28:43.280
It's not open to debate.

500
28:43.480 --> 28:45.680
We call it "only natural."

501
28:46.600 --> 28:47.600
Good.

502
28:47.680 --> 28:49.840
Then I'll use them in a sentence.

503
28:50.040 --> 28:51.800
When someone takes advantage of others

504
28:51.880 --> 28:53.560
and thinks it's only natural,

505
28:53.640 --> 28:54.680
I want to tell them,

506
28:54.760 --> 28:55.880
"This is outrageous!"

507
28:56.840 --> 28:58.000
You say you're so straightforward.

508
28:58.880 --> 29:00.240
Why not insult me to my face?

509
29:01.280 --> 29:03.360
I make one little dig at you, and you can't take it?

510
29:03.440 --> 29:05.320
But your brother insults me to my face, and you tell me to take it!

511
29:05.400 --> 29:06.560
Do you expect me to be a saint?

512
29:06.680 --> 29:08.120
So you could go to the shipping festival,

513
29:08.200 --> 29:10.480
I've tried so hard to learn the rules and put up with all their scolding.

514
29:10.560 --> 29:11.560
And what do you do?

515
29:11.640 --> 29:12.840
When I got back, you stopped me from speaking up for myself,

516
29:13.160 --> 29:15.080
then wrote those words to mock me!

517
29:15.160 --> 29:16.240
What's wrong with you?

518
29:16.560 --> 29:17.880
I'm done with this!

519
29:18.160 --> 29:19.200
Don't be angry, my lord.

520
29:19.280 --> 29:20.360
Lady Jin was praising you earlier.

521
29:22.240 --> 29:23.880
Didn't I tell you last night not to go?

522
29:24.080 --> 29:25.880
You dragged him there at daybreak.

523
29:26.000 --> 29:27.400
They gave you a light punishment.

524
29:27.480 --> 29:28.720
You weren't sent back to that dump

525
29:28.800 --> 29:30.920
only out of respect for me, the head of this household.

526
29:31.080 --> 29:33.000
Instead of thinking about what you did,

527
29:33.080 --> 29:35.160
you come here shouting orders at me!

528
29:35.240 --> 29:36.320
You, head of the household?

529
29:36.400 --> 29:38.480
You marry a woman, and think that makes this a home?

530
29:38.680 --> 29:39.680
Let me tell you.

531
29:39.760 --> 29:41.480
Home is where my heart is.

532
29:41.760 --> 29:44.160
This is just somewhere I can get a free meal.

533
29:44.240 --> 29:45.240
You ungrateful brat!

534
29:45.440 --> 29:46.680
Who would feed you if it weren't for me?

535
29:47.960 --> 29:49.680
Stay in your room today and think about what you've done.

536
29:49.760 --> 29:51.080
Swallow your pride and admit you're wrong.

537
29:52.440 --> 29:53.640
Apologize to me now,

538
29:54.160 --> 29:55.320
and I'll forget this ever happened.

539
29:55.400 --> 29:57.240
No! No! I won't!

540
29:58.640 --> 30:00.600
-Jianwei! -Yes, my lord.

541
30:00.680 --> 30:02.880
Tell everyone. Without my permission,

542
30:03.280 --> 30:06.120
she's not to have a single bite to eat, or even a drop of water!

543
30:06.200 --> 30:07.320
A drop of water?

544
30:07.440 --> 30:08.440
I'll tell you what!

545
30:08.520 --> 30:10.360
I have my own! I don't need yours!

546
30:10.600 --> 30:12.680
With one mouthful of spit, I could drown you!

547
30:12.880 --> 30:14.200
-I don't need yours! -Shrew!

548
30:14.440 --> 30:15.520
I've been looking everywhere for you.

549
30:15.600 --> 30:16.600
You didn't fight fair yesterday.

550
30:16.680 --> 30:17.720
Move!

551
30:18.040 --> 30:19.040
You--

552
30:19.160 --> 30:20.160
My lady!

553
30:21.080 --> 30:22.160
Yan!

554
30:22.880 --> 30:24.480
All you ever think about is having fun.
